<title>UK: Finland sets 2.0 bln Lux franc December 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Finland sets 2.0 bln Lux franc December 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg SA and Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINLAND</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    31.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.70    PAY DATE L  05.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     YIELD	5.65 PCT  L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 PRAECIPUUM 0.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
